---
title: "list_rebates (protocol::referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: self, who
    q_init --> q_alloc: coin_types = empty(), amounts = empty()
    q_alloc --> q_check: check user_rebates_records
    q_check --> q_return_empty: !self.user_rebates_records.contains(who)
    q_check --> q_load: self.user_rebates_records.contains(who)
    q_return_empty --> [*]: return (coin_types, amounts)
    q_load --> q_iter: user_rebates = self.user_rebates_records.borrow(who)
    q_iter --> q_push: has next key
    q_iter --> q_return_full: no more keys
    q_push --> q_iter: coin_types.push_back(key), amounts.push_back(amount)
    q_return_full --> [*]: return (coin_types, amounts)

    note right of q_iter
        INV-001: Output vectors coin_types and amounts have equal length
        INV-002: Each amount corresponds to the coin_type at same index
        INV-003: Returns empty vectors if user has no rebate records
    end note
